OL,3,CSpandau Ballet's Tony Hadley to
OL,4,Cheadline Jersey's Weekender Festival
OL,5,C2026
OL,7,FThe lead singer of the 80s band
OL,8,FSpandau Ballet, Tony Hadley, is one of
OL,9,Ffive acts announced to headline
OL,10,FJersey's Weekender Festival in
OL,11,FSeptember.
OL,13,FTaking place in People's Park in St
OL,14,FHelier, the 80s-inspired lineup also
OL,15,Fincludes Bros frontman Matt Goss,
OL,16,Fsinger-songwriter and multi-
OL,17,Finstrumentalist Nik Kershaw, and
OL,18,FScottish duo Hue and Cry on Saturday
OL,19,F12 September.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/3
