OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1785878312
OL,3,CSpandau Ballet's Tony Hadley to
OL,4,Cheadline Jersey's Weekender Festival
OL,5,C2026
OL,7,FThe bassist from the Britpop band
OL,8,FBlur, Alex James, was announced
OL,9,Fearlier this year to headline the
OL,10,Ffestival on Friday 11 September.
OL,12,FThe event will span two days, starting
OL,13,Fon the Friday at 5pm until 1am, and on
OL,14,Fthe Saturday from 3pm to 11pm.
OL,16,FCommenting on the lineup, festival
OL,17,Forganiser, Warren Le Sueur, says:
OL,18,F"From Matt Goss and Tony Hadley to Nik
OL,19,FKershaw and Hue and Cry, Saturday is
OL,20,Fgoing to be an incredible, hit-packed
OL,21,Fcelebration from start to finish.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/3
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
